<h1>David A. Dewar</h1>
<p>Illinois House, 35th District, on the Chicago ballot November 3, 2026. Party: Republican.</p>
<p><a href="https://www.repdaviddewar.com/" rel="nofollow noopener">Campaign site (repdaviddewar.com)</a></p>
<h2>Running on</h2>
<p>He says Springfield has a spending problem rather than a revenue problem and proposes a yearly outside forensic audit of state finances, repeal of the SAFE-T Act, support for police, and same-day paper ballots; he names illegal immigration as the district&#39;s most pressing issue.</p>
<h2>Background</h2>
<p>Independent retirement specialist who founded Tax-Free Retirement Solutions in 2010 after working in real estate, mortgage brokerage and life insurance, and served 10 years as an election judge in the 19th Ward.</p>
